{#
A toast and nothing else.

Saving an attachment to a service changes nothing on screen — the message and
its attachments are exactly as they were — so there is no frame worth
replacing. The confirmation is the whole response, which also means the thread
keeps its scroll position.
#}
<turbo-stream action="append" target="toast-region">
    <template>
        {% include '_partials/_toast.html.twig' with {
            message: toastMessage|trans(toastParams),
            type: isError ? 'error' : 'success',
        } %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
